<section class="content-section" id="overview-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="text-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">LLP Name Change in Mumbai &ndash; Overview</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
                    <p><strong>&#128204; TL;DR - LLP Name Change Services at a Glance</strong></p>
                    <p>LLP name change is the legal process of changing the registered name through MCA approval: RUN-LLP name reservation (valid 20 days, up to 2 names, Rs 200), Form 5 approval-based filing with ROC (15-30 days), supplementary LLP Agreement via Form 3 (linked form within 30 days), and fresh Certificate of Incorporation. Section 19 for voluntary changes, Section 20 for ROC/Central Government directed changes. Post-approval: update PAN, TAN, GST, bank, Maharashtra PT, all registrations. Late filing: Rs 100/day per form with no cap.</p>
                </div>
                <p>Mumbai LLPs change names for rebranding (Powai tech pivots), partnership transitions (BKC professional LLPs), business expansion (Fort trading LLPs), trademark alignment, and ROC Section 20 directions. Learn more about <a href="/llp-name-change">LLP Name Change across India</a>.</p>
                <p>Patron Accounting's Mumbai office at Marine Lines &ndash; adjacent to ROC Everest House &ndash; provides end-to-end services: name search + trademark check, RUN-LLP reservation, partners' resolution, supplementary deed on Maharashtra stamp paper, Form 5 + ROC approval management, Form 3 linked filing, and all post-approval updates (PAN/GST/bank/PT). For ongoing compliance, see LLP Compliance. For agreement amendments, see <a href="/llp-agreement-change">LLP Agreement Change</a>.</p>
                <p>Content is reviewed quarterly for accuracy.</p>
