<section class="content-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="text-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">Legal &amp; Compliance Framework for LLP Name Change</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Section 19:</strong> Voluntary name change with partner consent and ROC approval</li>
                    <li><strong>Section 20:</strong> Directed change &ndash; ROC/Central Government orders if undesirable or too similar</li>
                    <li><strong>RUN-LLP:</strong> Reserve Unique Name &ndash; up to 2 names, Rs 200, valid 20 days</li>
                    <li><strong>Form 5:</strong> Notice for Change of Name &ndash; approval-based with ROC</li>
                    <li><strong>Form 3:</strong> Supplementary agreement &ndash; linked form within 30 days of Form 5 approval</li>
                    <li><strong>Fresh COI:</strong> Issued by ROC with new name and same LLPIN</li>
                    <li><strong>MCA Naming Guidelines:</strong> Not identical/similar, not misleading, no prohibited words, must end with 'LLP'</li>
                    <li><strong>Penalty:</strong> Rs 100/day per form &ndash; no cap</li>
                    <li><strong>Maharashtra Stamp Act:</strong> Supplementary deed stamp duty (residual entry Rs 100-500)</li>
                    <li><strong>ROC Mumbai:</strong> Everest House, 100 Marine Lines, Mumbai 400020</li>
                </ul>
                <p><strong>Filing Portal:</strong> <a href="https://www.mca.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">mca.gov.in</a> (MCA V3 portal)</p>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

