                    <div class="faq-expanded__item" id="faq-2">
                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">How long does an LLP name change take?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>25-45 working days total. RUN-LLP (1-3 days), partner consent and deed (3-5 days), Form 5 ROC approval (15-30 days &ndash; main bottleneck), Form 3 (5 days after approval), post-approval updates (7-30 days). Patron manages parallel processing to minimise total time.</p></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-expanded__item" id="faq-3">
                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">What is RUN-LLP?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>Reserve Unique Name for LLP &ndash; MCA web service for name reservation. Up to 2 names per application. Rs 200 fee. No DSC required. Valid 20 days from approval. If both rejected, fresh application needed. Patron files with optimised name options for Mumbai LLPs.</p></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-expanded__item" id="faq-4">
                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">Do all partners need to agree?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>Yes, all designated partners must consent unless LLP Agreement specifies different mechanism. Resolution signed by all attached with Form 5. Without unanimous consent, Form 5 is rejected. Patron coordinates consent collection within the 20-day RUN-LLP window.</p></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-expanded__item" id="faq-5">
                        <h3 class="faq-expanded__q">What if the name is rejected by ROC?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-expanded__a"><p>If Form 5 rejected: fresh RUN-LLP with different name. If sent back for resubmission: update within 15-30 days or SRN cancelled. Common reasons: name too similar, prohibited word, incomplete docs. Patron's pre-filing search minimises rejection risk for Mumbai LLPs.</p></div>
